// Provenance S1: revenu de solidarité active (CASF, livre II,
// titre VI, chapitre II: droit et montant, droits et devoirs,
// sanctions, recouvrement, jeunes travailleurs, instruction des
// demandes, conventions, orientation, contrôle, statistiques),
// contrat d'engagement du code du
// travail (L. 5411-6) et article 12 transitoire du décret
// n° 2025-478. Block generated by tools/build_sources.py from the
// registries .scratch/reg-LEGITEXT000006074069.json (CASF),
// .scratch/reg-LEGITEXT000006072050.json (code du travail) and
// .scratch/reg-JORFTEXT000051672648.json (decree 2025-478), cut
// 2026-10-06, plus superseded version XMLs from the mirror dumps.
// The six decrees revaluing the montant forfaitaire (article 1 of
// decrees 2020-490, 2021-530, 2022-699, 2023-340, 2024-396 and
// 2025-293) come from sources/decrets-mf/ (tools/pin_mf_decrets.py;
// LEGI dump of 2025-07-13, retrieved 2026-10-08), together with
// article 9 of law 2022-1158 (coefficient 1.04 from 1 July 2022; the
// edition opens at that date, the consolidated LEGI version is in
// force from 2022-08-18; bytes shared with fr.css.revalorisation).
// Do not edit by hand.
//
// Coverage D-01 from 2021-01-01. Editions run back to back from
// the coverage start (decree: from its 2025-06-01 entry into
// force); every pinned version gets a fragment in each edition
// where it is in force.
// Decree article 13 (ministers charged with execution) carries no
// case content and is not pinned.
// L. 542- / R. 542- adaptations for the outre-mer are wave 7
// (SANS_OWNER): this package covers only the same-text metro/DOM
// scope of the articles above.

language "law.core" version "0.2";
package fr.casf.rsa version "0.1.0";
namespace "urn:fr:corpus:clir:rsa";

